# Direct pins for the Melange chain's compute image (ops/docker/compute-melange.Dockerfile); input of ops/locks/compute-melange.linux.txt.
# Every line of requirements.txt and fec/requirements-honors.txt, plus the third-party packages the 78 chain steps reach that those two
# files do not declare (opensmile, anthropic: installed on the host, declared nowhere). The set is proved by
# `python ops/compute/chain_imports.py --json` (AST census of fec/run_pipeline.py CHAIN, transitive through project modules).
# Versions are the Windows host's (CPython 3.12.10): the image has to reproduce the host's numbers, so no pin moves without a parity run.
# not the host's 49.0.0: CVE-2026-69247 (D-181); the chain census never imports cryptography, so no parity run is affected
